<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100755" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνοδ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>travel in company</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Charito
				2.3
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i>with</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				9.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.609d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				7.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astron.,
				<i>to be in conjunction</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῷ ἡλίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					2.29.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Cleom.
				1.3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				297.28
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			metaph., <i>have fellowship with</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				6.23(25)
			</span></i>; <i>accompany</i>, "
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ" ς. τῇ κλητικῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Trypho
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				48.19
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				89.21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνοδεῦσαι δεῖ πρὸς ταῦτα αἴσθησίν τε
					καὶ νοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Marcellin.
					<u>Puls.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> as 
				Pass.
			 or 
				Med.
			, <i>go with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς λαχάνοις -ευέσθω φύλλα μήκωνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Syn.</u>
				6.32
			</span></i> (v.l.).</div>
